{
  "caption": "Over the past few days, I competed in both the men’s doubles and mixed doubles at the ITF World Tennis Masters Tour MT400.\n\nThanks to my amazing partners, we managed to finish as runners-up! The funny thing is, the only things you get for finishing first or second are a piece of paper and ranking points. 🤣 So my thoughtful mixed doubles partner even prepared a medal for me. Now that’s what I call a proper sense of occasion! 😂\n\nBefore today’s match, my racquet strings broke. And being the amateur that I am, I had only brought one racquet, so I had to borrow someone else’s.\n\nI didn’t play particularly well today, so I guess I’ll just blame the racquet. 🤣🤣 Otherwise, we would’ve been champions! Haha.\n\nNever mind, there’s always next time. 🎾 #tennis",
